{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_14226560","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14226560","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:4:1422656001:1":{"text":"Everyone, Elona just sent word that Eironn has arrived.","source_cn":"诸位，艾洛娜刚刚传信，埃隆已经抵达了。他已经先行前往了...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5536866E1AF089CF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1422656002:1":{"text":"Wow, that was quick! Master Arden only sent the letter not long ago, and now he's already back.","source_cn":"好、好快啊？！从雅顿贤者发出信到他回来，这才过了多久？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4F8F9F4C265E751B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1422656003:1":{"text":"His destination may not have been far. Come, everyone. Let us go and meet him without delay.","source_cn":"他游历之处或许不是很远。诸位，事不宜迟，我们过去与他会合吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB7E48D5E0DDA2B72","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1422656004:1":{"text":"Now that Eironn is communing with the Deer Spirit, there is hope that the mystery hindering you shall be resolved.","source_cn":"有埃隆与鹿灵沟通，或许能解决你被阻拦的谜团。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x084278AA02F42320","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1422656005:1":{"text":"Yes, let us go.","source_cn":"嗯，我们走。